review:
You will like this game if you like:
1) 4-team coop games;
2) Horde-like games (similar to zombies, but less repetitive because there are more types of enemies);
3) Games with very high difficult settings (you can play in easy to normal modes from veteran to champion, or hard to very hard in Legend or Cataclysm, there is a setting for everyone);
4) Very different gameplay depending on the character you use (different from fps or coop shooters, every character has wide range of builds and skills you can change your gameplay completely and every character has more than one class to choose - tank, dps, ranged, mixed, etc);
5) using melee rather than only shooting enemies, which is not something you see very often in horde-like games.
